      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Gateway: is smart enough to route that request to correct \n                  microservice that route triggeres that's work of API \n                  gateway.\n\n- Basically and interface between client and microservices.\n\n- API Gateway is single entry for user request and it handles all req \nand navigate to respective miceroservices\n\n- User not direct communicate through services.",
      "fontSize": 20.307126951485124,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Gateway: is smart enough to route that request to correct \n                  microservice that route triggeres that's work of API \n                  gateway.\n\n- Basically and interface between client and microservices.\n\n- API Gateway is single entry for user request and it handles all req \nand navigate to respective miceroservices\n\n- User not direct communicate through services.",
