      "text": "- L4 LB (Work on TCP/UDP level so it didnt understand http req, http path, cookies, headers etc. in sabk ye read nhi kar skta)\n- see source IP add and PORT it see desctination IP and PORT and see protocal type (eg. TCP/UDP).\n- upr wali kuch chije hai jiske based pr L4 LB pata lagata hai ki user ki req ko kaha route karna hai",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- L4 LB (Work on TCP/UDP level so it didnt understand http req, http path, cookies, headers etc. in sabk ye read nhi kar skta)\n- see source IP add and PORT it see desctination IP and PORT and see protocal type (eg. TCP/UDP).\n- upr wali kuch chije hai jiske based pr L4 LB pata lagata hai ki user ki req ko kaha route karna hai",
