      "text": "TCP Establish when LB route req o Server2",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP Establish when LB route req o Server2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lXLVl2erRvSE8MBAnVgb2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11024.481378027715,
      "y": 1364.9976421397596,
      "width": 182.05797086397558,
      "height": 59.40588484102386,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cMz7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1241096455,
      "version": 890,
      "versionNonce": 1403711810,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788587777162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "one connection is esablish \nbetween client and server(eg. Server2) \nthen whenever client send \nmsg the LB route it to Server2 until \nwe broke conection.",
      "fontSize": 9.504941574563823,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "one connection is esablish \nbetween client and server(eg. Server2) \nthen whenever client send \nmsg the LB route it to Server2 until \nwe broke conection.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5nOXjdhZsnI5Cjwbu4whA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10446.844885290448,
      "y": 1518.902589134053,
      "width": 256.3740639144392,
      "height": 40.485148427113245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cMz8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1088965033,
      "version": 486,
      "versionNonce": 1125257246,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "yddjlnINtTAN_BJWarG5Z",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1788587777162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L4 LB sees that data packets are sending from \nclient to server but it cant read what inside it\n(eg.011010000011)",
      "fontSize": 10.796039580563528,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "L4 LB sees that data packets are sending from \nclient to server but it cant read what inside it\n(eg.011010000011)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "APT58yey315yjR7SDL_mq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10480.843781490663,
      "y": 1007.4773781267193,
      "width": 355.200439453125,
      "height": 13.49504947570441,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cMz9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1592578633,
      "version": 697,
      "versionNonce": 663920770,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "pGDMP65apsGltqBY6wtf7",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1788587777162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L7 is smart enough to understand to route request on best route..",
      "fontSize": 10.796039580563528,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "L7 is smart enough to understand to route request on best route..",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6Fxz7tKhBLgUFqaeWwBUo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10042.706127725727,
      "y": 1586.8499448629018,
      "width": 720.365177464718,
      "height": 32.45178760199714,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cMzA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1952907817,
      "version": 1042,
      "versionNonce": 1221009566,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788587777162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The L4 LB is like a post office clerk who only looks at the envelops \"From address\" and \"To address\" he never\nopenes the envelop to see what's inside it he just descide which truck to put in.",
      "fontSize": 12.980715040798856,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The L4 LB is like a post office clerk who only looks at the envelops \"From address\" and \"To address\" he never openes the envelop to see what's inside it he just descide which truck to put in.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
