      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Calculate TTFB (Time to first byte): time interval btw sending a req and recieving\nresponse from the server\n- Pick the server with has:\n  active connections * least TTFB (if it clashes go with the Round Robin)",
      "fontSize": 19.288420342479917,
