      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Calculate TTFB (Time to first byte): time interval btw sending a req and recieving response from the server\n- Pick the server with has:\n  active connections * least TTFB (if it clashes go with the Round Robin)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
