      "versionNonce": 1360252866,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788587777167,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Advantages of Reverse Proxy Server:\n- Hides identity of Server (IP Anonymility)\n- it also work as Load Balancer (it route the traffic also to preffered server\n- Caching\n- prevent from cyber attacks to server by showing fake ip of server",
      "fontSize": 22.55231795801314,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Advantages of Reverse Proxy Server:\n- Hides identity of Server (IP Anonymility)\n- it also work as Load Balancer (it route the traffic also to preffered server\n- Caching\n- prevent from cyber attacks to server by showing fake ip of server",
      "autoResize": true,
