      "updated": 1788587777167,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At second req by client to same site proxy server wahi sehi response de dega kyunki wo caching bhi karta hai so it's fast\n(eg. 1st time google.com req then client->proxyServer->Internet->server->response back to client via same path but 2nd\ntime req googl.com then client->proxyserver->response (Caching)",
      "fontSize": 10.976426338693592,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At second req by client to same site proxy server wahi sehi response de dega kyunki wo caching bhi karta hai so it's fast (eg. 1st time google.com req then client->proxyServer->Internet->server->response back to client via same path but 2nd time req googl.com then client->proxyserver->response (Caching)",
