      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788587777168,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP Protocol: \n- provide reliable connection\n- packets ki delivery ek order me hogi ek sequence me hogi\n- make sure every packet should be delivered.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP Protocol: \n- provide reliable connection\n- packets ki delivery ek order me hogi ek sequence me hogi\n- make sure every packet should be delivered.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3nkhn-mb24eJGc-edhY72",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12628.641128691408,
      "y": 1981.7973529203716,
      "width": 796.4040799033079,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cN6B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 374864835,
      "version": 1192,
      "versionNonce": 132815234,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788587777168,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UDP Protocol: \n- Conenctionless (No concept like Three way handshake)\n- Packets sending ka kuch order or sequence nhi hota\n- Doent care about every packet should be delivered.\n- By above three point this protocol become fast\n- Usage: Video Stream, Video Games, Video Calls etc.\n  ex: you are on video call with frnd and internet gone so\nthat frames are gone aap baadme firse us frames ko nhi\ndekhte to packets are lost\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UDP Protocol: \n- Conenctionless (No concept like Three way handshake)\n- Packets sending ka kuch order or sequence nhi hota\n- Doent care about every packet should be delivered.\n- By above three point this protocol become fast\n- Usage: Video Stream, Video Games, Video Calls etc.\n  ex: you are on video call with frnd and internet gone so   that frames are gone aap baadme firse us frames ko nhi dekhte to packets are lost\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
