      "text": "In client-server protocol no two clients can communicate\ndirectly they need server to communicate but in P2P\nclients directly can communicate with each other",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In client-server protocol no two clients can communicate directly they need server to communicate but in P2P clients directly can communicate with each other",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
