      "index": "cNVa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1264414306,
      "version": 855,
      "versionNonce": 1668072478,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788587777184,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problem is that ki u1 ne req ki so LB ne server 1 me jaane diya aur profile ka data cache kar liya and req fullfill kardi then after some time u1 ne firse req\nki but is baar LB ne req server3 pr jaane diya firse DB call caching works and req fullfill but now the data is redundant server 1 and 3 both have same\ncache data so data persist nhi reh paya isko fix karne ke liye we use request stickeyness",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problem is that ki u1 ne req ki so LB ne server 1 me jaane diya aur profile ka data cache kar liya and req fullfill kardi then after some time u1 ne firse req ki but is baar LB ne req server3 pr jaane diya firse DB call caching works and req fullfill but now the data is redundant server 1 and 3 both have same cache data so data persist nhi reh paya isko fix karne ke liye we use request stickeyness",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
