      "updated": 1788587777185,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example: Instagram\nGoal: how much bandwidth is used per second for image uploads on instagram",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example: Instagram\nGoal: how much bandwidth is used per second for image uploads on instagram",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rvIxS6zGszlO5zTFIeDMT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29752.10724969193,
      "y": 1787.1557506364416,
      "width": 714.702880859375,
      "height": 665,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cNXe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 968851924,
      "version": 659,
      "versionNonce": 378767326,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788587777185,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1Billion DAU (10^9)\n10% users uploads images Daily (10^9/10 = 10^8)\non an avg 1 user uploads 1 image/day\n\nApproximation and label the unit:\nEach image size is 2MB\n\n10^8 users uploads images every day\n=> 10^8 image upload/day = 100Miilion images/day\n\n100 million images/day * 2MB = 200Million MB/Day\nTotal upload data/day\n\n2 * 10^8 * 10^6 Bytes\n2 * 10^14 Bytes = 2 * 10^2 * 10^12 Bytes\n200TB/Day\n\n1Day = 24hr * 60min * 60sec = 86400 Seconds/Day\n=> 200TB/86400 = 2.3GB/second",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1Billion DAU (10^9)\n10% users uploads images Daily (10^9/10 = 10^8)\non an avg 1 user uploads 1 image/day\n\nApproximation and label the unit:\nEach image size is 2MB\n\n10^8 users uploads images every day\n=> 10^8 image upload/day = 100Miilion images/day\n\n100 million images/day * 2MB = 200Million MB/Day\nTotal upload data/day\n\n2 * 10^8 * 10^6 Bytes\n2 * 10^14 Bytes = 2 * 10^2 * 10^12 Bytes\n200TB/Day\n\n1Day = 24hr * 60min * 60sec = 86400 Seconds/Day\n=> 200TB/86400 = 2.3GB/second",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
